# 💼 AI Job Application & Mailbox Tracker

An intelligent job application tracking system built with Python, Streamlit, Google Gemini API, and ChromaDB. The application automatically connects to your Gmail inbox, filters job-related communications, extracts status updates, and highlights pending actionable next steps using RAG and LLM classification.

## 🌟 Key Features

- **Automated Mailbox Scanning:** Connects to Gmail via IMAP and retrieves recent emails related to job applications.
- **Rule-Based Pre-Filtering:** Filters out non-job emails (e.g., GitHub notifications, delivery status failures, security alerts) before LLM ingestion to optimize API usage.
- **LLM Application Categorization:** Categorizes email statuses into `Applied`, `Action Required`, `Assessment Sent`, `Interview Scheduled`, `Offer Received`, or `Rejected`.
- **Actionable Next Steps Extraction:** Automatically pulls specific task deadlines, interview details, or pending candidate forms.
- **Resume RAG Integration:** Parses PDF resumes and stores contextual embeddings in ChromaDB to compare job postings against your skill background.
- **Interactive Streamlit Dashboard:** Displays status metrics, real-time progress indicators, actionable dataframes, and detailed breakdown cards.

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

- **Frontend / Dashboard:** [Streamlit](https://streamlit.io/)
- **LLM Engine:** [Google Gemini API](https://ai.google.dev/) (`gemini-3.8-flash`)
- **Vector Storage / RAG:** [ChromaDB](https://www.trychroma.com/)
- **Email Ingestion:** Python `imaplib` & `email`
- **Language & Runtime:** Python 3.13

## 📂 Project Structure

```text
job-application-tracker/
├── .env                  # API keys and Gmail credentials (ignored by Git)
├── .gitignore            # Git ignore file
├── requirements.txt      # Project dependencies
├── resume.pdf            # Candidate resume for RAG search
├── src/
│   ├── __init__.py
│   ├── gmail_fetcher.py  # Email fetching & pre-filtering logic
│   ├── rag_engine.py     # ChromaDB PDF parser & RAG retriever
│   └── agent_system.py   # Gemini LLM analysis & fallback handler
└── app.py                # Streamlit dashboard entry point